<!-- REVIEWS -->
<section class="rev" id="reviews">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Rated 4.9 from 125+ reviews</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;margin-top:10px">What buyers say</h2></div></div>
    <div class="rev-top">
      <div class="rev-score">
        <div class="num">4.9</div>
        <span class="stars">★★★★★</span>
        <div class="cnt">51 verified reviews</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rev-bars">
        <div class="rev-bar"><span class="lab">5 ★</span><span class="track"><span class="fill" style="width:95%"></span></span><span class="pc">95%</span></div>
        <div class="rev-bar"><span class="lab">4 ★</span><span class="track"><span class="fill" style="width:5%"></span></span><span class="pc">5%</span></div>
        <div class="rev-bar"><span class="lab">3 ★</span><span class="track"><span class="fill" style="width:0%"></span></span><span class="pc">0%</span></div>
        <div class="rev-bar"><span class="lab">2 ★</span><span class="track"><span class="fill" style="width:0%"></span></span><span class="pc">0%</span></div>
        <div class="rev-bar"><span class="lab">1 ★</span><span class="track"><span class="fill" style="width:0%"></span></span><span class="pc">0%</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rev-cards">
      <div class="rev-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h4>They're cute & stayed put</h4><p>“The quality is amazing and the grip is the best I've had on any grip socks. The design is so cute too, a must for any Pilates or Yoga lover!”</p><div class="who">Verified buyer · Amazon</div></div>
      <div class="rev-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h4>Will buy another pair</h4><p>“The grip is really good quality and stops me slipping around when I wear them, thick and really comfortable.”</p><div class="who">Fergy · Verified buyer</div></div>
      <div class="rev-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h4>Became her favourite</h4><p>“I gifted these and they became her favourite! The colours and quality are so good, sooo pretty.”</p><div class="who">Evelyn · Verified buyer</div></div>
      <div class="rev-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h4>So comfy & cute</h4><p>“So comfy and cute. They wash nicely and have great grip.”</p><div class="who">Wendy · Verified buyer</div></div>
      <div class="rev-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h4>Stayed put in class</h4><p>“Cute, and they stayed put on my feet in class. LOVE these, going to order more!”</p><div class="who">Giselle · Verified buyer</div></div>
      <div class="rev-card"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><h4>Just as good as studio brands</h4><p>“Super cute, very grippy, just as soft and thick as other brands I've bought in-studio before!”</p><div class="who">Verified buyer · Amazon</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


